  "explanation": "The question asks when the Adriatic was launched. The sources clearly identify three distinct ships named 'Adriatic':\n\n1. **RMS Adriatic (1906)**: Document D1S5 states she was launched on 20 September 1906.\n2. **SS Adriatic (1871)**: Document D2S3 and D3S1 both state she was launched on 17 October 1871.\n3. **Adriatic (1811 ship)**: Document D4S5 states she was launched in 1811 in the United States.\n\nEach of these is a separate vessel with its own launch date. There is no contradiction among them since they refer to different ships. All three dates are directly supported by the original sources and should be retained."
